# Generated output, kept out of git because one command remakes it and
# the full deck alone is 1.7 MB of cover photograph:
#
#   node ../render.mjs --share   > ../../../site-energy/share/pitch.html
#   python3 ../make-pdf.py       -o Sunlogic-Pitch-full.pdf
#   python3 ../make-pdf.py --one-pager -o Sunlogic-Pitch-one-pager.pdf
#   node ../render.mjs --screen  > Sunlogic-Pitch.html
#
# standard-deck.json IS committed: it is small, and it is the fixture a
# test or a bug report can be pointed at.
*.pdf
*.html
